+  shapes get white rules and white shapes get black ones.
+- **The void is ink**, with sparse paper ash streaks falling through it.
+- **Fire:** a white-hot core sprite (mono) inside accent flicker sprites.
+  Soft halos are hidden in ink mode, because there is no blur in ink.
+- **The hero pops:** Larry is `paper` over a hard-edged solid-ink shadow pool
+  (1.35× the classic blob). Without it the white cage vanished into hatched
+  floors.
+- **Keep the accent a detail:** big additive glows and the lava sea are dimmed
+  in ink mode so they fall to hatching. Only small, hot things reach solid
+  accent.
+- **Palettes** (`INK_PALETTES`): Sin (each level's own accent), Blood `#ff1f2d`,
+  Ember `#ff7a1a`, Gilt `#ffc21f`, Absinthe `#6aff3a`, Neon Lust `#ff2ad4`,
+  Pure Noir (accent = paper), Negative (paper `#0a0a0a` on ink `#f2efe8`).
+- **Chrome in ink:** only the three role colours (`--ink-c`, `--paper-c`, `--acc-c`).
+  Square panels with 2 px paper rules, a hard 5 px accent offset shadow, paper
+  buttons with ink text, and no gradients or glows (`body.ink` in larry's
+  `style.css`).
+- **Settings:** a ⚙ card with Art style (HELLFIRE / SIN CITY) as a segmented
+  control, a palette grid of ink/paper/accent swatches, and Sound. `C` /
+  `Shift+C` cycles palettes. `?art=ink&palette=blood` overrides the saved choice.
 
