+## Surface tiles for a rolling ball (labyrinth-larry `physics.js`)
+
+Each surface modifies the grounded step only (base accel 22, friction 0.55/s, max speed 17):
+
+| Tile | Effect | Numbers | Reads as |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| Tar (Sloth) | drag | accel ×0.55, friction 3.2/s → terminal speed ≈ 3.8 u/s; carry momentum in | near-black pools |
+| Grease (Gluttony) | slide | accel ×0.4, friction 0.04/s | yellow tint + pulsing sheen |
+| Wind (Lust) | shove | +13 u/s² along the tile's direction (vs 22 steering) | scrolling arrow decals |
+| Coins (Greed) | temptation | +100, placed on spurs off 1-wide ledges | spinning gold discs |
